        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Community Officer positions are for the second  $ (2^{nd}) $ shift from 5:15 a.m. – 3:15 p.m. or 5:30 a.m. – 3:30 p.m. with varying days off depending on the level of the SUMMIT Community; these various days off will be posted prior to the bid; and third  $ (3^{rd}) $ shift from 2:30 p.m. – 10:30 p.m. Any employee who bids these shifts may be assigned as a primary SUMMIT Community Officer for any SUMMIT Community at management's discretion.",
