        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Bidding Process. Employees who have completed initial trial service may bid shifts and days off in order of seniority as defined in Section 8 of this Article. Employees who fail to successfully bid, or who do not apply or bid, will be assigned at the discretion of the institution's management.",
