        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Bids will address start and stop times for all shifts and days off work schedules. Employees may submit up to three (3) bids. Employees may bid in person, by telephone, or by proxy. Bids shall be submitted in priority order. Employees shall secure a shift and days off work schedule in order of seniority as defined in Section 8 of this Article along with the exceptions as noted in subsection b of this Article.",
